@ai = http://localhost:5300

### Health
GET {{ai}}/health

### Build the local in-memory index from current storefront listings
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/admin/reindex

### Anonymous or personalized recommendations
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "comfortable products for daily use",
  "excludeListingIds": [],
  "take": 6
}

### Chat
POST {{ai}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is in my cart and what would you recommend?",
  "history": []
}
